    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha Nadabu na Abihu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni a ba Nadabu nū Abihu, bakabūūcha būlī ng'wene lyahulīlo lyakwe, bahula moto ūyo gwalī gūtazunīlīgije; hūna būtūūla na būbbani wa kūzuukīja; benha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA kīnhū īsho walī atabalagīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla moto gwafuma kūlī SEEBA gūūbabbiisha, būchīla henaho kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Alooni, “Ū mhayo gwenūyo h'ūyo SEEBA akagūhaya aho akayomba gīkī, ‘Ū kū banhū abo bakūneegeelaga nakwiyoolecha gīkī nalī ng'wela. Pyī hose na hose ūko banhū balī, nakwinhwa ikūjo.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alooni akagayiwa ū gwa kūhaya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbitana ba Mishaeli na Elizafati, bitūnja ba ng'wa Uzieli ise ndo o ng'wa Alooni;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ise ndo o ng'wa Alooni:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hū kūhaya walī saabo ndo a ba Alooni nū Musa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūbawīla, “Nzūgi mubabūūche a baana ba ng'wing'we, mubīnje ū kwipandī lyeela, mubatwale hanze ya ng'hambī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biza būbabūūcha; abo bakazumalīka baalī bataalī mu ng'hanjo jabo ja milīmo; būbatwala hanze ya ng'hambī, gīt'ūmo Musa akabawīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe a ba Eliezeli nū Itamaali, “Mutizūjilekanīja ī nzwīlī jing'we jisakaalīle sagala, yaya nūūlū kūtandūla shizwalo shing'we, nguno numho mukūcha; nīyo ū SEEBA akūlīpelanīla nī libità lya banhū pyī ī lyose. A badūgū bing'we a ba numba ya Isilaeli a bose hū bene bakūbalīla abo SEEBA wabakenaagūlaga na moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we yaya ū kwīnga a ha nyango gwiheema lya kwibilingīla; ūlū mulīīte gīko mukūcha, nguno mulī basolwa ba ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa kwitīīlwa maguta.” Ng'hana bīīta gīt'ūmo Musa akabawīlīla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Īyo Ībigeleelilwe Bagabīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Alooni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū bebe na a bitūnja bako ūlū mulī na lūdīīma lwa kwingīla ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, yaya ū kūng'wa divai nūūlū shing'wiwa shingī shose shose, īsho shidūgije kūnkola munhū; ūlū ng'wīta chene mukūcha. Ī shilagīlo shenīshi shilī sha būja na būja ū mu shibyalīlwe shing'we īsho shiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we shing'wigeleelilwe ng'wīdeebe ī mihayo, ī myeela ī ya kogohwa ng'wīlekanya nī ya shikū jose ū mu kaīle ka banhū; hama nī yawiza ng'wīlekanya nī misoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we īng'wigeleelilwe kūbalanga a Baisilaeli pyī ī shilagīlo īsho SEEBA wabinhile mu nzīla ya ng'wa Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa shilīwa sheela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'wīla ū Alooni na a bitūnja bakwe a ba Eliezeli nū Itamaali, abo bakashiiga; ūhaya, “Shisolagi ī shakwinha sha būsu īsho shasaagaga ha shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto, mushizuge shitī na shibimbya, mushilīīle ha ng'walīlo; nguno shilī sheela no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukūyūshilya mulī ng'wipandī lyeela, nguno ū gwenūyo ngabo gwako ū bebe, hamò na a bitūnja bako, gwa kūfuma ū mu shakwinha īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto; h'ūmo naalagīīlilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī shiguuku sha kūyengeejiwa, nū gūlūmbū gwa kūfunyiwa, ī shene ūkūshilya ū bebe na a bitūnja bako, hamò na a bashīke bako. Mukūshilya mulī ng'wipandī lyeela; ū gwenūyo ngabo gwako ūhelelilwe bebe hamò na baana bako, ūyo gūkūfunyiwa kūbiza shakwinha sha būsangī īsho Baisilaeli bakūyūfunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gūlūmbū gwa kūfunyiwa, nī shidali sha kūyengeejiwa shiigelile shenhwe, hamò na a masazu ayo gakīītagwa kūbiza shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya moto; shenhwe shiyengeejiwe kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, shibize shakwinha sha kūyengeejiwa. Ū gwenūyū gūkūbiza ngabo gwing'we gwa shikū jose, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walagīīlile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho wabūūja ūko yalī yatūūlwa ī mbūli ya shitambò sha shibi, ūwīlwa gīkī yalī yamala kūpemva moto. Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūnsayīsha, ūbasayīla a bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni, a ba Eliezeli nū Itamaali, abo baalī basaagīīla; ūbabūūja gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nibūlī aho mulī ng'wipandī lyeela mutashiliile ī shitambò sha shibi? Ī shoi ī shenīshi shilī shakwinha sheela no no no; ng'winhiwe bing'we kūlwa kwīnja kwihīga kwa banhū, ībize nzīla ya kūbeeja isangī kūlwa nguno yabo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalī īng'wigeleelilwe kwīlya ī mbūli yenīyo aho mulī ng'wipandī lyeela, nguno a mininga gayo gaalī gatatwalilwe ū mu gatī y'iheema; h'ūmo nakamuwīlīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alooni ūng'wīla, “Ī lelo īyī bamfunījaga ū SEEBA shakwinha shabo sha shibi, nī sha kūpemva; yanigwīīlaga mitaale ū nene! Ū SEEBA ni wayega gete ūlū ni nashilya ū nene ī shitambò sha shibi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa aho wigwa ū būsombooji wenūbo ūyega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
